# RETIRED — legacy Alembic history only

This directory is retained solely as historical migration material from the
pre-consolidation backend layout. It is **not** an Alembic script location and
must never be used to create, upgrade, stamp, or otherwise operate a runtime
database.

The sole canonical migration configuration is the repository-root
`alembic.ini`, which targets the repository-root `alembic/` tree. The former
`backend/alembic.ini` execution entrypoint has been deliberately removed to
prevent ambiguous migration invocation while preserving this historical tree.
